ra. A lui si unisono altri 3 ragazzi, trasformatisi in supereroi: Rhinobone, Jaguarbone e Sharkbone. Il quartetto di guerrieri White Bone si opporrà - utilizzando le Bone Cards - a Dark Bone, il malvagio avversario, che si nasconde nell’oscurità e trama di distruggere il pianeta. I nostri eroi dovranno stare molto attenti, perché il vero nemico si potrebbe celare dentro di loro…"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Majin Bone","overview":"Majin, the creator of the Universe, has been resurrected in the present day. Shougo Ryuujin, an ordinary high school student who transforms into the Bone Fighter, Dragon Bone with the Bone Card in order to save Earth. Together, with the other White Bone warriors take a stand against the Dark Bone, a foe that has appeared from darkness to devastate Earth. However, \"could the true enemy be ourselves?\""},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"突如、宇宙の創造主「魔神」が復活。時を同じくして、闇からの訪問者が静かに降臨した。地球に危機が忍び寄ろうとする中、3人の若者が1人の少年を追っていた。その少年とは竜神翔悟、どこにでもいる普通の高校生だ。彼の前に現れた「ダークボーン」が容赦なく襲いかかってきたその時、驚くべきことが起こる！"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/baL57n9tvDpverjyLxHEJn9ygd2.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/baL57n9tvDpverjyLxHEJn9ygd2.png","language":"xx","width":378,"height":276},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xFUNy7xVxwyUQpKlu5A3j95dQjB.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xFUNy7xVxwyUQpKlu5A3j95dQjB.png","language":"xx","width":590,"height":283}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6niT3oJyu4Gt0yj0IsaUpycGEZm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6niT3oJyu4Gt0yj0IsaUpycGEZm.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1426},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jujBRKWhHfTmxgtP207CChEJCnD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jujBRKWhHfTmxgtP207CChEJCnD.jpg","language":"ja","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cBHr9Yt1umUm0wJoNwRFS0JQZyB.j